# 1. Supabase Local Configuration Coordinates (Link with local dev CLI)
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://localhost:54321
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImxvY2FsLWVudmlyb25tZW50...

# 2. National Labor Compliance Defaults
REGIONAL_MINIMUM_WAGE=6000.00

# 3. LINARA web dashboard origin (optional) -- managers' in-app dashboard
# (app/manager.tsx) loads from here, defaulting to the deployed one when unset,
# and password-reset emails open its /reset-password page. Add that URL to Supabase Auth > URL Configuration >
# Redirect URLs too, or Supabase won't send the link there.
EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_APP_URL=https://your-linara-web.vercel.app

# 4. Sentry (optional) -- errors and activity logs. Nothing is reported unless
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT is set; eas.json sets it for preview and production builds, so
# leave it out of a local .env. EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN replaces the committed
# linara-mobile DSN (lib/observability/config.ts) and is only needed to report
# to a different Sentry project. Readable stack traces need source maps: add
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN as an EAS secret, then drop SENTRY_DISABLE_AUTO_UPLOAD from
# each profile in eas.json (it keeps builds green while there is no token).
